{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000c9dd","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a08841-b416-7e52-96f7-950fb1e6ed56"},"sequence":841,"recorded_at":1780531400001677,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"82802766-dfb1-4d49-b692-3924c0687d9f","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"82802766-dfb1-4d49-b692-3924c0687d9f","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"82802766-dfb1-4d49-b692-3924c0687d9f"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"01a08846-4702-7ef1-b632-ab3ff98ec2c7"},"task_id":"01a08846-4702-7ef1-b632-ab3ff98ec2c7","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"01a08846-4702-7ef1-b632-ab3ff98ec2c7","chunk":"{\n  \"chunk_id\": \"exec-16-1\",\n  \"command\": \"grep -rn \\\"leaseB\\\" internal/sessquery/*.go | head; echo ===; grep -n \\\"sessquery\\\\|SelectionPlan\\\\|selector\\\" README.md | head -n 30\",\n  \"description\": \"Find leaseB constant and README selector docs\",\n  \"exit_code\": 0,\n  \"terminal_status\": \"completed\",\n  \"output\": \"internal/sessquery/plan_test.go:292:\\t\\tappendEventAs(t, reader.Local, idA, launched, \\\"lease.transferred\\\", 1, 2, leaseB, map[string]any{\\ninternal/sessquery/plan_test.go:294:\\t\\t\\t\\\"predecessor_lease_id\\\": lease, \\\"new_lease_id\\\": leaseB,\\ninternal/sessquery/resolve_test.go:19:// leaseB is a second fencing token for successor-lease fixtures.\\ninternal/sessquery/resolve_test.go:20:const leaseB = \\\"bbbbbbbb-cccc-4ddd-8eee-ffffffffffff\\\"\\n===\\n715:means. Every job proves its selection matched something: a test selector,\\n1791:and a third covers the 24 handled v1 event types derived from direct-selector\\n1794:adds the ownership prerequisite: every production `Type` selector, including\\n1801:Unrelated selectors named `Type` also need classification.\\n1808:battery with disjoint behavioral, census and static-audit selectors; a\\n1833:## Session selector, read summaries, and selection plans\\n1835:`internal/sessquery` is the single shared selector API over the persisted\\n1837:v0.6.0 selector contract (§14.7/§14.7.1, refining §2.3) with shared\\n1838:SelectionPlan construction and revalidation (§14.7.2):\\n1849:  Explicit unknown aliases/hosts are `selector_source_not_found`; known\\n1851:  are `selector_source_read_failed` with the cause preserved; local I/O\\n1860:- Immutable plans: `Reader.BuildPlan` binds the literal selector,\\n1865:  boundary in `BoundariesFor`; divergence is `selector_plan_stale`,\\n1894:in [the task evidence map](internal/sessquery/TRACEABILITY.md).\\n1897:go test ./internal/sessquery ./internal/sessrepo -count=1 -v\\n1898:python3 internal/sessquery/testdata/mutate.py /absolute/path/to/new/evidence-dir\\n\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 1609,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 403,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}","final_result":true}}}
