{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000cbd7","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a08841-b416-7e52-96f7-950fb1e6ed56"},"sequence":1094,"recorded_at":1780531400002183,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"82802766-dfb1-4d49-b692-3924c0687d9f","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"82802766-dfb1-4d49-b692-3924c0687d9f","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"82802766-dfb1-4d49-b692-3924c0687d9f"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"01a08848-942d-7cf2-86f6-e71bf6e88e7e"},"task_id":"01a08848-942d-7cf2-86f6-e71bf6e88e7e","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"01a08848-942d-7cf2-86f6-e71bf6e88e7e","chunk":"edited\nchanged lines: lines 152-161\n--- original\n+++ updated\n@@\n-\t// ConfigurationDigest is the digest of the effective validated\n-\t// configuration, including peer mapping, allowlist, and transport.\n-\tConfigurationDigest string\n-\t// LeaseEpoch, LeaseID, and OwnerHostID come from the validated\n-\t// winning envelope lease: positive uint53, UUIDv4, and UUIDv7. All\n-\t// three stay empty together while no winning lease is observed;\n-\t// unknown is unknown, never a placeholder.\n-\tLeaseEpoch  uint64\n-\tLeaseID     string\n-\tOwnerHostID string\n+\t// ConfigurationDigest is the digest of the effective validated\n+\t// configuration, including peer mapping, allowlist, and transport.\n+\tConfigurationDigest string\n+\t// LeaseRecordID is the locally attested canonical digest of the\n+\t// validated winning-lease observation (session, epoch, lease ID,\n+\t// owner). This stack persists no standalone Lease Record objects;\n+\t// the observation is the envelope triple on the authoritative\n+\t// event chain, and the digest is recomputed from validated facts,\n+\t// never fabricated and never a placeholder.\n+\tLeaseRecordID string\n+\t// LeaseEpoch, LeaseID, and OwnerHostID come from the same validated\n+\t// winning-lease observation as LeaseRecordID: positive uint53,\n+\t// UUIDv4, and UUIDv7. A plan with no observed winning lease is\n+\t// never built; the builder refuses selector_bootstrap_incomplete.\n+\tLeaseEpoch  uint64\n+\tLeaseID     string\n+\tOwnerHostID string\n","final_result":true}}}
