{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000dcfb","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a08841-b416-7e52-96f7-950fb1e6ed56"},"sequence":3288,"recorded_at":1780531400006571,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"82802766-dfb1-4d49-b692-3924c0687d9f","payload_type":"run.terminal.completed","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"run_terminal","command_id":"82802766-dfb1-4d49-b692-3924c0687d9f","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"82802766-dfb1-4d49-b692-3924c0687d9f"},"terminal":"completed","text":"Ready for review — handed off to review.\n\nAll four rev2 review findings are implemented in the shared selector layer (`internal/sessquery`), with the reviewer's three regression tests carried verbatim into [review_test.go](/Users/iv/Developer/ReluxWorks/agent-session-manager/.temp/STORY-260830-3tq4ns/worktree/internal/sessquery/review_test.go) and green:\n\n- **Union revalidation** — `Revalidate`/`BuildPlan` now validate the pinned UUID across local and every allowlisted source ([revalidate.go](/Users/iv/Developer/ReluxWorks/agent-session-manager/.temp/STORY-260830-3tq4ns/worktree/internal/sessquery/revalidate.go)): contradictory records are `integrity_failure`, contradictory leases/tombstones are stale, names are never re-resolved (same-name drift stays current by test).\n- **16-member plan** — `lease_record_id` binds the locally attested digest of the validated winning envelope lease (no standalone Lease Record objects exist in this stack; stated exactly, nothing fabricated). Record-only builds refuse `selector_bootstrap_incomplete`; unknown-local-host builds refuse `invalid_config`.\n- **Authoritative summaries** — `List`/`Status` refuse record-only bootstraps whole-list; new `AuthoritativeStatus`/`AuthoritativeList` ([summary.go](/Users/iv/Developer/ReluxWorks/agent-session-manager/.temp/STORY-260830-3tq4ns/worktree/internal/sessquery/summary.go)) bind host/observation facts or refuse `selector_observation_unavailable`. `InspectLocal` keeps raw recovery access by design.\n- **Narrowing evidence** — all `&& false` disables replaced with single-member admissions plus new mutants for every new gate: 33 narrowing + 3 ordering, all KILLED, battery exit 0. One first plant SURVIVED and exposed that the \"record replacement\" fixture presents as a parked chain-mismatch — corrected and documented.\n\nValidation on the final candidate, all exit 0: build, vet, gofmt, full suite (26 packages), coverage 90.9/87.6/92.2%, race, JSON gate. AC coverage 8/8 at shared-library entries, 0/8 CLI as stated caller bound. Checklist 19/19; three outcome resources attached (`results-rework.md`, `mutants-rework.json`, `validation-rework.log`); candidate left UNCOMMITTED at checkpoint `83640d1`; LOGBOOK entry added.","reason":null}}
